    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d205-a3">

                <pb facs="0301" n="197" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg197"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3—Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Messrs. Morgan, Grenfell &amp;
                            Co. to the American Group.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-04-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 12, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Currency. Impossible to get any answer from European groups today in time for
                    decision. We leave it to you therefore to cable McKnight that while willing
                    continue advance you will take no steps continue option. It will then be for
                    English, French, German groups act as they think fit in the matter and we have
                    advised them accordingly.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
